OL,3,CCarlisle United headcoach looks ahead
OL,4,Cto new league season
OL,6,FAlice Neil looks ahead to Carlisle's
OL,7,Ffirst match of the season
OL,9,FNew Blues boss Rob Elliot has warned
OL,10,Fthat Worthing will be tough opponents
OL,11,Fahead of their opening game of the
OL,12,FNational League season this Saturday.
OL,14,FElliot has radically remodelled the
OL,15,Fsquad, moving to play more
OL,16,Faggressively up front, and says the
OL,17,Fambition this season is promotion back
OL,18,Finto the Football League.
OL,20,F"Getting off to a good start is what
OL,21,Fwe want.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
