PN,32802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786529900
OL,3,CCarlisle United headcoach looks ahead
OL,4,Cto new league season
OL,6,F"We've got a huge club with a
OL,7,Ffantastic fan base.
OL,9,F"We know we want to get out of this
OL,10,Fleague, and I think the only thing I
OL,11,Fcan stress is that we can't do it on
OL,12,FSaturday, but what we can do is make a
OL,13,Fstart.
OL,15,F"We just have to go out to win every
OL,16,Fsingle game, that's it, that's our
OL,17,Fmindset.
OL,19,F"You can't win a title until April, so
OL,20,Ffor me we will just look at this
OL,21,FSaturday how do we win this Saturday?
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786529900
OL,3,CCarlisle United headcoach looks ahead
OL,4,Cto new league season
OL,6,F"The plan is not just to win this
OL,7,FSaturday, but to win every Saturday,
OL,8,Fand that's how we work is everything
OL,9,Fwe do is to win, not just one
OL,10,FSaturday, but every one, with
OL,11,Fadaptations for each opposition
OL,13,FThe Blues narrowly missed out on
OL,14,Fpromotion in their last campaign,
OL,15,Fdespite a record point score.
OL,17,FCarlisle United's vice-captain, Callum
OL,18,FWhelan, said the team has faced a
OL,19,Ftough few seasons, but is hopeful that
OL,20,Fthey can go one step better this time
OL,21,Faround.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
