CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786529900
OL,3,CCarlisle United headcoach looks ahead
OL,4,Cto new league season
OL,6,F"It's not easy to turn a ship around
OL,7,Fand get going in the right direction
OL,8,Fagain.
OL,10,F"I think we had a real good go at it
OL,11,Flast year.
OL,13,F"This season feels like perfect timing
OL,14,Ffor us to really push for the first
OL,15,Fposition and promotion.
OL,17,F"We're ready, we've had a really good
OL,18,Fpre-season.
OL,20,F"There's a real belief this season
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/4
